    "title": "API Reference",
    "description1": "Orxis exposes a clean FastAPI REST backend that powers every generation and tweak operation. This page documents every endpoint, its request schema, expected response format, and relevant error codes — everything you need to call the API directly, integrate it into your own tooling, or extend it with new routes.",
